      "writtenOn": "2022-02-14T15:54:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Would it be okay with you to do this in a forthcoming CL? It\u0027s a bit unfortunate that each class derived from SkTypeface_FreeType has its own `onGetFontDescriptor()`, so I was thinking it would get a bit noisy if I do this in the same CL. Filed as https://bugs.chromium.org/p/skia/issues/detail?id\u003d12948",
      "parentUuid": "cbb18798_38510d98",
      "revId": "88736c5aa3a705d561b690795ad8cb089f894daa",
